---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQs ✦ Dosezy Frequently Asked Questions">
	<Header />
	<main class="flex-grow pt-28 sm:pt-32 pb-16 bg-[#030407] bg-grid-pattern">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			
			<!-- Hero Header -->
			<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
				<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-300 border border-sky-500/20">
					FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS
				</span>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white font-display">
					Frequently Asked Questions
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-4 text-neutral-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
					Find simple, friendly answers about Dosezy features, pill reminders, stock tracking, adherence analytics, offline privacy, and family profile management.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Live Search Input -->
			<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
				<div class="relative">
					<input 
						type="text" 
						id="faq-search" 
						placeholder="Search questions (e.g. undo intake, search medicines, snooze duration, refill, reliability shield)..." 
						class="w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0c10] border border-white/10 text-white placeholder-neutral-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-sky-500/50 text-sm shadow-xl"
					/>
					<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z" />
					</svg>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- FAQ Accordion List -->
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4" id="faq-list">
				
				<!-- Question 1: What is Dosezy -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden" open>
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>What is Dosezy?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
						Dosezy is a simple, friendly, and smart medication reminder app. It helps you, your family members, and caregivers manage daily medicines, set alarms, track pill inventory, monitor adherence progress, and ensure no dose is ever missed.
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 2: Account & Offline -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>Do I need to create an account or have internet?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
						No! Dosezy is 100% local-first and offline. You do not need to register, log in, or have an internet connection. All your health data and reminders stay safely stored directly on your phone in an offline database.
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 3: Grouped Alarms & Dynamic Snooze -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>What happens if I take multiple medicines at the same time?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>Dosezy automatically combines all medicines scheduled for the exact same minute (e.g. 8:00 AM) into a single grouped alarm screen.</p>
						<p>You get an interactive checklist of your medicines with photos, meal instructions, a prominent green <strong>"Take All"</strong> button, and an orange <strong>"Snooze"</strong> button configured to your preferred snooze duration (5, 10, 15, 20, or 30 minutes in Preferences).</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 4: Dose Undo -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>What if I accidentally tap "Take" on a dose by mistake?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>Dosezy includes an instant <strong>Intake Undo</strong> action. When you confirm a dose, a 5-second snackbar with an <strong>"Undo"</strong> button appears.</p>
						<p>Additionally, medication cards on the Home screen remain interactive with an enabled Undo button. Tapping Undo immediately rolls back the dose status to Pending and restores the deducted pill count back into your stock inventory.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 5: Completion Banner -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>Can I still review today's schedule after all medications are taken?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>Yes! When all doses for today are completed, Dosezy displays a celebratory completion banner at the top of the Home screen, while keeping the full day's medication schedule visible underneath.</p>
						<p>You can review dosages, food instructions, and recorded taken timestamps anytime, as well as undo accidental marks if needed.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 6: Search & Filter Medicines -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>How do I search or filter medications in large rosters?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
						On the <strong>Medicines</strong> screen, an instant search bar is available at the top. Simply type any part of the medication name or instructions to filter your roster in real time.
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 7: Notification Reliability Shield -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>What is the shield icon on the top bar and how does it ensure alarms ring?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>The shield icon on the top bar is the <strong>Notification Reliability Status</strong> button, accessible from main screens and subpages. When green, all system permissions required for exact alarms are verified.</p>
						<p>Tapping the shield opens a live diagnostic checklist covering Exact Alarms, Notifications, and Battery Optimization bypass, with 1-tap links directly to your OEM settings (Samsung, Xiaomi, etc.) so alarms are never suppressed by battery savers.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 8: Discontinue & Archive -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>How do I stop a medication without losing past adherence history?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
						Instead of permanently deleting the medicine, open the medication and select <strong>Discontinue / Archive</strong>. The medicine will move to your Archived Medications list. All past compliance logs, adherence statistics, and calendar history are preserved permanently.
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 9: Stock Tracking -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>How does pill stock and refill tracking work?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>When adding or editing a medicine, turn on <strong>Track Stock Inventory</strong>, enter your current count (e.g. 60) and your low-stock threshold (e.g. 10).</p>
						<p>Every time you mark a dose as "Taken", Dosezy automatically subtracts the dosage amount from your stock and displays an orange <strong>⚠️ Refill Warning</strong> badge when it is time to reorder.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 10: Supported Languages -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>Does Dosezy support my native language?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>Yes! Dosezy features complete native translations across all alarms, notifications, cards, and menus in 12 major languages:</p>
						<p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-sky-300">English, Spanish, Hindi, Chinese, Portuguese, Arabic, French, German, Japanese, Russian, Italian, and Bengali.</p>
						<p>The app automatically detects your phone's system language, and you can change it anytime in <strong>Menu > Preferences > General > Language</strong>.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 11: Status Colors -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>How do dose status colors work on the Home screen?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p><strong class="text-emerald-400">Green:</strong> Dose confirmed as Taken (shows exact recorded time).</p>
						<p><strong class="text-white">Normal Text:</strong> Dose is upcoming or due recently (within your customizable Late Window).</p>
						<p><strong class="text-amber-400">Orange:</strong> Dose is Late (within your customizable late-to-missed window). An orange "Mark Late" action appears.</p>
						<p><strong class="text-red-400">Red:</strong> Dose is Missed (past your "Consider Missed After" window).</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 12: Emergency Contacts & Backup -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>How do emergency calling and personal contact backups work?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4 space-y-2">
						<p>In <strong>Menu > Emergency Contacts</strong>, Dosezy offers 1-tap dialing for national public emergency lines (ambulance, police, fire) across 10 regions, plus custom personal contacts for your family doctor, daughter/son, or caregiver.</p>
						<p>Emergency contacts are scoped per user profile to keep personal contacts isolated between family members, and are automatically included in encrypted backups in <strong>Menu > Backup & Restore</strong>.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<!-- Question 13: Doctor Reports & Exports -->
				<details class="faq-item vercel-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0c10]/95 group overflow-hidden">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-white text-base hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors list-none">
						<span>How do I export my data for doctor visits?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-neutral-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
						</svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="px-6 pb-6 text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
						Go to <strong>Menu > Export Data</strong> and choose <strong>PDF Report</strong> to generate a clean, printable medical report with current prescriptions, timings, food instructions, and adherence logs formatted for your doctor. You can also export full CSV or encrypted ZIP backup archives.
					</div>
				</details>

			</div>

		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>

<script>
	const faqSearch = document.getElementById('faq-search') as HTMLInputElement;
	const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item');

	if (faqSearch) {
		faqSearch.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
			const query = (e.target as HTMLInputElement).value.toLowerCase();
			faqItems.forEach(item => {
				const text = item.textContent?.toLowerCase() || '';
				const match = text.includes(query);
				(item as HTMLElement).style.display = match ? 'block' : 'none';
			});
		});
	}
</script>
